<!-- doc/src/sgml/release.sgml -->
<!--
 
 Typical markup:
 
 &<>                             use & escapes
 PostgreSQL                      <productname>
 postgresql.conf, pg_hba.conf,
         recovery.conf           <filename>
 [A-Z][A-Z_ ]+[A-Z_]             <command>, <literal>, <envar>, <acronym>
 [A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]+()        <function>
 -[-A-Za-z_]+                    <option>
 [A-Za-z_]+/[A-Za-z_]+           <filename>
 psql                            <application>
 pg_[A-Za-z0-9_]+                <application>, <structname>
 [A-Z][A-Z][A-Z_ ]*              <type>
 [a-z]+_[a-z_]+                  <varname>
 
 non-ASCII characters            find using grep -P '[\x80-\xFF]'
                                 convert to HTML4 named entity (&) escapes
 
         official:      http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/sgml/entities.html
         one page:      http://www.zipcon.net/~swhite/docs/computers/browsers/entities_page.html
         other lists:   http://www.zipcon.net/~swhite/docs/computers/browsers/entities.html
                        http://www.zipcon.net/~swhite/docs/computers/browsers/entities_page.html
                        http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_XML_and_HTML_character_entity_references
 
         we cannot use UTF8 because SGML Docbook does not support it
 
         do not use numeric _UTF_ numeric character escapes (&#nnn;),
         we can only use Latin1
 
         Example: Alvaro Herrera is &Aacute;lvaro Herrera
 
 wrap long lines
 
 For new features, add links to the documentation sections.
 
 -->
 
 <appendix id="release">
  <title>发布说明</title>
 
  <para>
   发布说明包含每个 <productname>Pgpool-II</> 版本的重要变更，主要功能和迁移
   问题在顶部列出。发布说明不包含只影响少量用户的变更，也不包含内部变更（因此
   对用户不可见）。
  </para>
 
  <para>
   通过查看每个版本的 <!--<link linkend="git">-->Git<!--</link>--> 日志，可以获得每个版本
   的完整变更列表。
   <ulink
    url="http://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-committers/"><literal>pgpool-committers</literal>
    邮件列表</ulink>也记录了所有源代码变更。还有一个
   <ulink url="http://git.postgresql.org/gitweb?p=pgpool2.git;a=summary">网页界面</ulink>
   ，可以查看特定文件的变更。
  </para>
 
  <para>
   每项旁边出现的名字代表该项目的主要开发者。当然，所有变更都经过了社区讨论和
   补丁审查，因此每一项都是真正的社区协作成果。
  </para>
 
  <!--
  To add a new major-release series, add an entry here and in filelist.sgml.
 
  The reason for splitting the release notes this way is so that appropriate
  subsets can easily be copied into back branches.
  -->
 
  &release-4.7;
  &release-4.6;
  &release-4.5;
  &release-4.4;
  &release-4.3;
  &release-4.2;
  &release-4.1;
  &release-4.0;
  &release-3.7;
  &release-3.6;
  &release-3.5;
  &release-3.4;
  &release-3.3;
  &release-3.2;
  &release-3.1;
 
 </appendix>
